+  50: // Queue depths. The hi lane carries interactive PTY traffic (keystrokes,
+  51: // output, resize) and is deep so a burst of output never starves input. The
+  52: // lo lane carries bulky, latency-tolerant control plane (state snapshots,
+  53: // stats, activity data, tool events).
+  54: const (
+  55: 	hiQueueDepth = 1024
+  56: 	loQueueDepth = 128
+  57: )
